|--- parser.lua              > Tree‑sitter helpers (get node path, node type) ||
|--- summoner.lua            > path resolution logic (handles patterns, literals, directory creation) ||
|--- picker.lua              > telescope/fzf integration (the `lio_picker` function) ||
|--- decor.lua               > conceal and highlighting (from liotree-conf.lua) ||
|--- config.lua              > user options (picker, createdir policy, etc.) ||
